  "description": "We are delighted to have the pleasure of introducing this beautiful two-bedroom apartment situated in a quiet area to the rental market with immediate availability to move in. The property consists of two double bedrooms, with wardrobe space, an open-plan kitchen/living room, a master ensuite and a main bathroom. Within walking distance of Coolmine Railway Station, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, and within easy access to M50/N3 motorways and a host of local amenities and services.\n\nShort term lease - 6 months \n\nFacilities:\nParking is provided both underground.  There is also private parking available outside the apartment \nCentral Heating (Gas)\nElectricity\nAccess to the garden \nWashing Machine\nOven/Hob\nFridge Freezer\nPrivate Patio/Balcony\nMonthly refuse collection is included in the monthly rent\nThe master bedroom is ensuite and is fully furnished.\nThe main bathroom has a shower and a bath.\nSecond bedroom:  Will take a double bed or two single beds (you will need to provide your own bed for the second bedroom)\nDining room and chairs are not included in the rental; will need to provide your own.  Fully furnished, elsewhere.\n\nPlease email to be considered:\nA brief letter of application telling us a little bit about you\nConfirm how many people this two-bed apartment is for?\nReferences from previous landlords,\n\nEmail only with the information requested for consideration\nand we will be back to you within 24 hours.\n\nThank you.",
